  citizenName: Cankurtaran Can
  citizenRole: "Hamidiye A\xE7\u0131k Y\xFCzme Havuzu"
  vendorShopId: 
  isBrave: 1
  chatLines:
  - "Hamidiye A\xE7\u0131k Y\xFCzme Havuzu'na ho\u015F geldin! \u0130ster k\xF6\u015Fedeki
    merdivenden in, ister atlama ta\u015F\u0131ndan suya dal!"
  - "Su tertemiz ve serin; havuzdan \xE7\u0131karken merdivenden y\xFCr\xFCyebilir
    ya da kenarda z\u0131plama tu\u015Funa bas\u0131p g\xFCverteye t\u0131rmanabilirsin."
  - "G\xFCne\u015Flenmek istersen \u015Femsiyelerin alt\u0131ndaki \u015Fezlonglar
    bo\u015F, keyfine bak!"
