  citizenName: "R\u0131za Abi"
  citizenRole: "95 Selman \xC7ay Oca\u011F\u0131"
  vendorShopId: shop_coffee
  isBrave: 1
  chatLines:
  - "Buyur ge\xE7, demli \xE7ay yeni demlendi! 95 numara Abd\xFClkadir Udeh k\xF6\u015Fesinde
    soka\u011F\u0131n bulu\u015Fma noktas\u0131d\u0131r."
  - "Kar\u015F\u0131daki beyaz evin \xF6tesinden do\u011Frudan M\xFCr\u015Fit Caddesi
    ve Sultanbeyli merkeze \xE7\u0131k\u0131l\u0131r."
  - "A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131 Abd\xFClkadir Udeh Soka\u011F\u0131'ndan bakt\u0131n m\u0131
    Hz. Osman Camii'nin \xE7ift minaresi hemen g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr."
