  candidateSeats: []
  walkSpeed: 0
  turnSpeed: 6.5
  humanoid: {fileID: 1556886075}
  citizenName: Mahmut Usta
  citizenRole: "Hafsa Tesisat \xB7 Kombi & S\u0131hhi Tesisat"
  vendorShopId: shop_hafsa
  isBrave: 1
  chatLines:
  - "Buyur karde\u015Fim, Hafsa Tesisat'a ho\u015F geldin! S\u0131hhi tesisat, do\u011Falgaz,
    kombi bak\u0131m\u0131 ve petek temizli\u011Fi bizde."
  - "Ocak so\u011Fuklar\u0131nda Aydos'tan esen r\xFCzgarla Hamidiye'de kombiler
    hi\xE7 durmaz, yeti\u015Fmeye \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131yoruz."
  - "48 numaran\u0131n arkas\u0131ndaki tu\u011Fla in\u015Faat\u0131n b\xFCt\xFCn
    kalorifer tesisat\u0131n\u0131 da haftaya biz d\xF6\u015Feyece\u011Fiz."
  - "Arac\u0131n i\xE7in acil yak\u0131t bidonu ya da malzeme laz\u0131msa tezgahtan
    verebilirim."
