    ba\u015F\u0131na \xFC\u015F\xFC\u015F\xFCr."
  - "Hamidiye Muhtarl\u0131\u011F\u0131'ndan Z\xFCbeyde Han\u0131m Caddesi'ne kadar
    herkes Selman Bakkal & Manav'\u0131 bilir!"
  - "\u0130stersen kasa band\u0131na gel, istersen do\u011Frudan reyonlardan al\u0131\u015Fveri\u015F
    yap kom\u015Fu."
