  vendorShopId: 
  isBrave: 1
  chatLines:
  - "Aman dikkat et karde\u015F, \xC7i\xE7ek\xE7i Soka\u011F\u0131 a\u011Fz\u0131ndaki
    kasise h\u0131zl\u0131 girersen araban\u0131n \xF6n tak\u0131m\u0131 da\u011F\u0131l\u0131r!"
  - "Seyyid Kutup Caddesi'nden \xE7\u0131k\u0131p Z\xFCbeyde Han\u0131m ve Eyy\xFCbi
    Caddesi \xFCst\xFCnden G\xF6let'e ba\u011Flan\u0131yoruz."
  - "Sabah i\u015Fe yeti\u015Fenler G\xF6let Giri\u015Fi dura\u011F\u0131nda s\u0131raya
    giriyor, Sultanbeyli sabahlar\u0131 \xE7ok hareketli olur."
