  - "Kar\u015F\u0131daki Sad\u0131k Abi'nin k\u0131raathanesinde ak\u015Famlar\u0131
    b\xFCt\xFCn kom\u015Fular tavla oynay\u0131p sohbet ederiz."
  - "Z\xFCbeyde Han\u0131m ve Aziziye caddelerinden g\xFCneye inince soka\u011F\u0131m\u0131z
    \xE7am kokusuyla kar\u015F\u0131lar."
